---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Vyroba Wood - El Don de la Madera">
  <main class="relative">
    
<!-- Hero Section: Macro Visual Focus -->
<section class="relative min-h-[921px] flex items-center overflow-hidden bg-surface">
<div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-20 bg-grid-slate-200"></div>
<div class="container mx-auto px-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center relative z-10">
<div class="lg:col-span-7">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-secondary font-bold tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-4 block">Precisión de Ingeniería</span>
<h1 class="font-cabinet font-black text-7xl md:text-9xl leading-[0.85] tracking-tighter text-primary mb-8">
                        EL DON DE <br/>LA MADERA
                    </h1>
<p class="font-satoshi text-xl max-w-xl text-on-surface-variant mb-10 leading-relaxed">
                        Where architectural rigour meets the soul of the forest. We engineer timber with a precision that honors every fiber.
                    </p>
<div class="flex gap-4">
<button class="bg-secondary text-white px-10 py-5 font-cabinet font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-secondary-container transition-all">Explore Collections</button>
<button class="border border-outline px-10 py-5 font-cabinet font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-surface-container transition-all">Technical Catalog</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lg:col-span-5 relative">
<div class="aspect-[4/5] bg-surface-container-low overflow-hidden ">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="extreme macro close-up of dark walnut wood grain showing intricate cell structure and warm honey-colored highlights in natural light" src="/images/stitch/stitch_1.jpg"/>
</div>
<div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-primary p-8 text-on-primary hidden md:block">
<div class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] tracking-widest mb-2 opacity-60">PRECISION DATA</div>
<div class="font-cabinet font-black text-2xl">0.02mm TOLERANCE</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Catálogo de Madera Modules: Material Samples -->
<section class="py-24 bg-surface-container-low relative">
<div class="container mx-auto px-10">
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-16 gap-8">
<div>
<h2 class="font-cabinet font-black text-5xl uppercase tracking-tighter text-primary">PRECISION ARQUITECTONICA</h2>
<div class="h-1 w-24 bg-secondary mt-4"></div>
</div>
<p class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-outline max-w-xs text-right">
                        SYSTEMATIC CLASSIFICATION OF PREMIUM HARDWOODS FOR STRUCTURAL INTEGRITY.
                    </p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-0 border border-outline-variant/30">
<!-- Sample 1: European Oak -->
<div class="group bg-surface hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 p-8 border-r border-b border-outline-variant/30 relative">
<div class="aspect-square bg-surface-dim mb-8 overflow-hidden grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="top-down macro view of European Oak plank with prominent rings and light golden hues, high texture detail" src="/images/stitch/stitch_2.jpg"/>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-secondary border border-secondary/20 px-2 py-1">VW-0101</span>
<h3 class="font-cabinet font-bold text-xl uppercase">EUROPEAN ROBLE</h3>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4">
<div class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-outline uppercase tracking-tighter">Densidad<br/><span class="text-on-surface font-bold">720 KG/M³</span></div>
<div class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-outline uppercase tracking-tighter">Stability<br/><span class="text-on-surface font-bold">EXCEPTIONAL</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Sample 2: American Nogal -->
<div class="group bg-surface hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 p-8 border-r border-b border-outline-variant/30 relative">
<div class="aspect-square bg-surface-dim mb-8 overflow-hidden grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="rich deep chocolate brown American Nogal wood texture with flowing organic patterns and silky finish" src="/images/stitch/stitch_3.jpg"/>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-secondary border border-secondary/20 px-2 py-1">VW-0402</span>
<h3 class="font-cabinet font-bold text-xl uppercase">AMERICAN NOGAL</h3>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4">
<div class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-outline uppercase tracking-tighter">Densidad<br/><span class="text-on-surface font-bold">610 KG/M³</span></div>
<div class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-outline uppercase tracking-tighter">Stability<br/><span class="text-on-surface font-bold">MODERATE</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Sample 3: Black Ash -->
<div class="group bg-surface hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 p-8 border-r border-b border-outline-variant/30 relative">
<div class="aspect-square bg-surface-dim mb-8 overflow-hidden grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="high contrast black stained ash wood grain with deep ridges and architectural texture profile" src="/images/stitch/stitch_4.jpg"/>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-secondary border border-secondary/20 px-2 py-1">VW-0912</span>
<h3 class="font-cabinet font-bold text-xl uppercase">BLACK FRESNO</h3>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4">
<div class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-outline uppercase tracking-tighter">Densidad<br/><span class="text-on-surface font-bold">670 KG/M³</span></div>
<div class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-outline uppercase tracking-tighter">Stability<br/><span class="text-on-surface font-bold">HIGH</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Sample 4: Hard Arce -->
<div class="group bg-surface hover:bg-white transition-all duration-300 p-8 border-b border-outline-variant/30 relative">
<div class="aspect-square bg-surface-dim mb-8 overflow-hidden grayscale group-hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="pale cream colored hard maple wood surface with very fine subtle grain and smooth satin luster" src="/images/stitch/stitch_5.jpg"/>
</div>
<div class="space-y-4">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-secondary border border-secondary/20 px-2 py-1">VW-0210</span>
<h3 class="font-cabinet font-bold text-xl uppercase">HARD ARCE</h3>
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4">
<div class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-outline uppercase tracking-tighter">Densidad<br/><span class="text-on-surface font-bold">740 KG/M³</span></div>
<div class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-outline uppercase tracking-tighter">Stability<br/><span class="text-on-surface font-bold">SUPERIOR</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Technical Specifications Section -->
<section class="py-24 bg-primary text-on-primary">
<div class="container mx-auto px-10">
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20">
<div>
<h2 class="font-cabinet font-black text-6xl tracking-tighter mb-12">TECHNICAL<br/>INTEGRITY</h2>
<div class="space-y-8">
<div class="flex items-start gap-6 border-l-2 border-secondary pl-8 py-2">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-secondary font-bold text-2xl">01</span>
<div>
<h4 class="font-cabinet font-bold text-xl uppercase mb-2">Humedad Calibration</h4>
<p class="font-satoshi text-on-primary-container text-sm leading-relaxed">All timber is kiln-dried to a precise 8.2% moisture content before milling to ensure absolute dimensional stability in varied climates.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-6 border-l-2 border-outline/30 pl-8 py-2">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-outline font-bold text-2xl">02</span>
<div>
<h4 class="font-cabinet font-bold text-xl uppercase mb-2">Joint Engineering</h4>
<p class="font-satoshi text-on-primary-container text-sm leading-relaxed">Utilizing CNC-milled finger joints and blind tenons, achieving structural bonds that exceed the original wood's strength.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-start gap-6 border-l-2 border-outline/30 pl-8 py-2">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-outline font-bold text-2xl">03</span>
<div>
<h4 class="font-cabinet font-bold text-xl uppercase mb-2">Architectural Acabado</h4>
<p class="font-satoshi text-on-primary-container text-sm leading-relaxed">Multi-stage orbital sanding up to 400 grit, followed by biological wax impregnation for a breathable, durable protection.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-surface-container-highest/10 p-10 relative">
<div class="absolute top-4 right-4 font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-[10px] text-secondary tracking-widest uppercase">Spec Sheet V4.0</div>
<h3 class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-on-primary-container mb-10">Metric Analysis</h3>
<div class="space-y-6">
<div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<span class="font-satoshi text-sm">Hardness (Janka)</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs font-bold text-secondary">1,450 LBF</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<span class="font-satoshi text-sm">Elastic Modulus</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs font-bold text-secondary">12.6 GPA</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<span class="font-satoshi text-sm">Crushing Strength</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs font-bold text-secondary">7,100 PSI</span>
</div>
<div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-white/10 pb-4">
<span class="font-satoshi text-sm">Tangential Shrinkage</span>
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs font-bold text-secondary">8.6%</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-12">
<img class="w-full h-48 object-cover opacity-50 contrast-125" data-alt="technical architectural drawing of a furniture joint overlaid with blue drafting lines on a white background" src="/images/stitch/stitch_6.jpg"/>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Signature Component: Macro Detail -->
<section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2">
<div class="h-[600px] bg-secondary-container overflow-hidden">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover" data-alt="side view macro detail of a dovetail wood joint with incredible precision and alternating light and dark wood tones" src="/images/stitch/stitch_7.jpg"/>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col justify-center p-20 bg-surface">
<span class="font-space font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] text-xs text-secondary font-bold tracking-[0.4em] uppercase mb-6 block">The Joint Detail</span>
<h2 class="font-cabinet font-black text-5xl uppercase leading-[0.9] tracking-tighter mb-8">INVISIBLE <br/>STRUCTURALISM</h2>
<p class="font-satoshi text-lg text-on-surface-variant mb-12 leading-relaxed">
                    A perfect joint is not just a connection; it is a mathematical triumph. Our craftsmen utilize hybrid milling techniques to achieve seams that disappear into the wood's own narrative.
                </p>
<div>
<button class="bg-primary text-on-primary px-12 py-5 font-cabinet font-black uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-primary-container transition-all">Download CAD Blocks</button>
</div>
</div>
</section>

  </main>
</Layout>
